### get all posts
GET http://localhost:8000/posts

### get all posts - page 2, 5 per page
GET http://localhost:8000/posts?page=2&limit=5

### get post by id
GET http://localhost:8000/posts/1234

### get posts by sender
GET http://localhost:8000/posts?sender=Mayan

### get posts by sender - page 1, 10 per page
GET http://localhost:8000/posts?sender=Mayan&page=1&limit=10

### create new post
POST http://localhost:8000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "message": "hi! what's up?",
    "sender": "1234"
}

### update post
PUT http://localhost:8000/posts/1234
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "message": "updated message content"
}

### like post
PATCH http://localhost:8000/posts/1234/like
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "method": "like"
}

### dislike post
PATCH http://localhost:8000/posts/1234/like
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "method": "dislike"
}
